      "sling:resourceType": "cq/experience-fragments/editor/components/buildingblock",
      "text140174845397495": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-7065227e84@example.invalid",
        "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-2-5em\">The results are in</span></span></p>\n<p>The Target Coil platform delivers coil conformability, softness and&nbsp;volume in a single product family—and the Target Registry proves&nbsp;the effectiveness of Target Coils for the treatment of intracranial&nbsp;aneurysms. The investigator-initiated study demonstrated a&nbsp;low 2.4% retreatment rate and strong functional outcomes for&nbsp;the patient. Target Coils have been a trusted product for over a&nbsp;decade. And the evidence is a big reason why.</p>\n<p><span class=\"futura-bold\">Primary endpoints:</span><br>\nAneurysm packing density</p>\n<p><span class=\"futura-bold\">Secondary endpoints:</span><br>\nImmediate and long-term aneurysm occlusion rate<br>\n(Raymond scale) and independent functional outcome (mRS)</p>\n",
        "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Feb 18 2022 20:55:08 GMT+0000",
        "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
        "textIsRich": "true",
